[statement]
The walk takes candidates by priority before version, unlike the choice
between them: `pa`, providing `v` at 1 with priority 100, is walked before
`pz`, providing it at 2, so `q2` is decided first, though `pz` is the one
installed for `v`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v

P:pa
V:1
p:v=1
k:100
D:q2 q1

P:pz
V:1
p:v=2
D:q1 q2

P:c1
V:1
p:q1
k:100

P:c2
V:1
p:q1 q2=1
k:10


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install c2 1
install pz 1
install app 1
